    "body": "The maintainer tested this again by hand, 2026-11-14, and wrote:\n\n> i can confirm that ctrl+click - does NOT add to the selection list.. it just \"changes\" between the two picked edges.. It might be a UI thing that it gets hidden.\n\nThis does not agree with the worker's finding above. The worker's test made Ctrl+click picks for Face, Contour, Pocket, Trace, Adaptive2D, Offset2D, Engrave and Pocket3D only. It did not test Slot, Chamfer2D, Finish3D or the other 3D and multi-axis kinds.\n\nNext step:\n- Find the operation kind and the page state where Ctrl+click replaces the picked edge.\n- Examine the selection list of the Geometry page: it is possible that the list shows only one row while the selection holds two edges.\n- Add a test that fails on the present behaviour.\n\nThe toolpath part (two open edges as the walls of a region with open ends) stays as recorded above.\n",
