    "body": "The maintainer gave the sequence that he used, 2026-11-14:\n\n> i had to click one edge, then ctrl click another edge, then ctrl click another edge again. then two edges got selected.\n\nReading of this sequence:\n1. A click picks edge A. The selection holds A.\n2. The first Ctrl+click on edge B does not add B. The selection still shows one edge.\n3. The second Ctrl+click on an edge gives a selection of two edges.\n\nThus the first Ctrl+click after a plain click does not add to the selection. The test that pins this must do the sequence click, Ctrl+click, and must expect two edges after step 2.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
